WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.340
Humanity, originating on earth,
spread out to the Moon, Mars, Jupiter...

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:14.610
...onward until it spread its influence
to the depths of the solar system.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:19.480
And then came the fateful year, 2137.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.280
It all started with the Sun.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.590
The Geduld Phenomenon.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.400
An enormous solar flare erupted
across the Earth's orbital plane.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.140
To this date, eighty years after its birth,
the composition of this high temperature...

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.380
...high gravity
phenomenon remains a mystery.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:53.320
Travel within the solar system has been
drastically reduced as a result of Geduld.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.810
We find ourselves right in the midst of it.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:00.220
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:07.800
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.800
Although loneliness...

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:16.140
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:23.370
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:28.450
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.420
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:38.950
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.730
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:46.360
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.060
Some light is shed...

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:54.640
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:01:54.640 --> 00:02:01.880
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:09.880
The things I want have no shape

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:18.290
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.350
Unnecessary Things

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.330
Outer wall of Area fifty-two
is forty-six percent melted.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.950
This is far above our safety range!

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.100
Why can't we get through to
the central control room?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.290
I don't know!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.460
Are we gonna end up melting in Geduld?

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.630
That's highly likely.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:58.270
Heigar! This isn't practice!
How can you be so calm!

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:00.410
What do you mean? This is
exactly when we should be calm.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.970
Stop arguing.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.910
Hurry up and make a decision, Juli!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.210
That's right! You're the top gun here!

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.840
But... I'd tell you if I knew.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.820
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:14.290
But the ship doesn't have
enough energy to re-ascend.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.690
We're hopeless without the
instructors! We're all gonna die!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.750
There's no choice. I'll take charge here...

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:24.760
How deep can Liebe Delta descend?
Calculate the time till the ship is crushed!

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:30.760
Yes, calculate the time till we're crushed!
And also get descending Herschel data.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.970
I'm already doing that!

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.310
Oh... okay...

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:39.580
Isolating areas 50 and 51 with partitions!
Switch the contaminated blocks to auto!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.320
Can't we switch controls from
the central room to here?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:47.350
This ship is a training center,
after all. I think we can get 75.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:51.230
Transferring data on depth
limit. 45 of Sere Three.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.900
We should be able to get the
remaining time from that!

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.630
Got it!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.470
Send it to me.

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:57.930
Hurry up!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.240
Time before Liebe Delta is crushed...

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.800
...fourteen hours, seventeen minutes.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.070
There's not enough time.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.550
<i>You need your brain checked, brother!</i>

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.090
<i>Hell of a time to be Mr. Niceguy!</i>

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:24.060
<i>Stop involving other people</i>
<i>in your selfish beliefs!</i>

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:28.290
You piss me off! You're such a
hypocrite, it's not funny! You bastard!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.900
Hey, the light's flickering!

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:36.160
If you don't wanna die, I
suggest you hurry outta here!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.040
Why are... we here?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.220
Come on, it's all right now.
It's no longer shaking.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.090
There's no need to worry.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.550
Come here, Rafra.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.580
What was that sound we heard?

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:03.000
Beats me. I'll bet the instructors messed
up and hit the pillar against something.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.530
Pat. I've gotta go out for a moment.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.470
Again?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:12.630
I've gotta go to work. I'll be back
shortly, so wait in your room. Here you go.

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.340
Darn... It's always, work, work, work.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:21.150
Don't be so hard on me. I'll play
with you all you want when I'm done.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.520
Anyway, be a good boy while I'm gone.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.310
All right, then. See you later.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.020
See you later!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.860
Hey! What the hell happened there?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.660
You rewrote the source, didn't you?

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.700
Come on. Stop it.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.240
Why should I?

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.430
When I say no, I mean no.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:49.130
- Bring it up further! Further!
- Let's go get something to eat.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:56.250
It seems like the outer wall is broken,
but we haven't heard any announcements.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.240
You think Ikumi and Kouji are okay?

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.280
They'll be fine, Yuki's looking for them.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.290
Mhm, they'll be fine!

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.860
<i>Damn Yuki.</i>

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:12.930
Once we get outta here, let's get
to a higher area as quickly as we can.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:16.270
Without knowing the situation,
there's little we can do to stop this.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.540
Hey, Ikumi. Are you listening?

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.550
That person was waiting.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:31.540
I'm sure, whoever was on the other
side was waiting for me to come.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:36.780
Yet we couldn't do a thing. Not a thing!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.650
Not again! Not... again!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.060
We're inside the Geduld.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.640
It's a place where people can't survive.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.940
So what?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.670
So we can't worry about it.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.540
You're talking just like that other guy!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.540
No, I <i>don't</i> want it to happen again.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.910
That's why we're learning the technology.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:02.380
Unbelievable! You're right,
I can't argue! But still!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.820
Ikumi. Think about right now.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.830
Let's hurry.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.700
The grahp here is rising.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:36.120
Sorry.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.620
I'll be right back.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.240
The outcome?

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.750
We're done with Area Thirty-two. 90
percent of the survivors are children.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:05.550
What about the Bratica?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.050
It seems the head master
really didn't know.

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:10.520
The incident happened over
ten years ago, after all.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.420
Okay. We'll leave the rest to Captain Conrad.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.680
What's happening in central control?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.660
Every passage is blocked. We can't get in.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.600
The head master's been killed?

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.130
What?

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:30.270
Temperature of Liebe Delta's
outer wall continuing to increase.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:34.410
Outer wall of areas 49 and 50 are melted
37 percent. Grahp levels are rising...!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.340
Yes! Liebel has enough power to escape.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.450
What?

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.180
Can we move it?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:43.420
The training ship? But we
failed in our earlier attempt.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:47.720
That's right! There's no way we can get it
ready for flight in only fourteen hours!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.460
But it's our only hope.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.560
Precisely.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:51.730
You must be kidding.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:52.530
What is it?

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.000
Life support system is given top priority.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.240
What in the world is happening?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.000
Huh? This thing isn't working!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.870
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.040
You must have broken it.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.440
Hey, Blue. I think
something's actually wrong.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.370
This way's no good either. All
because of my stupid brother!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.480
Aoi!

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.410
I've gotta let everyone know!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.880
H-Hey! Don't leave me behind!

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.750
I remember there being an elevator ahead.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.220
I wonder how things are above.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.830
- Hey.
- Yeah?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.290
That guy we saw earlier is
your little brother, right?

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:08.800
Yeah.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.300
You two aren't much alike.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:15.210
Forget about him. But I
was wondering, back there...!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:22.750
I guess this area's no longer safe either.
We'd better hurry or we'll be locked in!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:26.290
That way!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.900
I've pulled the lines over.
We can make our announcement.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.160
Okay, here I go!

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.930
<i>Everybody! Please remain calm and listen.</i>

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:42.400
<i>I am a student of the second term</i>
<i>Zwei, Navigation Section, Juli Bahana.</i>

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:47.870
<i>The Liebe Delta is currently in a
<i>crisis. This is not a training session.</i></i>

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.510
<i>This is actually happening.</i>

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:55.040
<i>Someone has altered Liebe Delta's</i>
<i>course, and it is currently descending.</i>

00:10:55.850 --> 00:11:01.060
<i>The center pillar base has been damaged,</i>
<i>and outer walls of Area 32 destroyed.</i>

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.590
<i>We have less than 14 hours</i>
<i>before we reach Sere 3...</i>

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.630
<i>...at which point the ship will not survive!</i>

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:10.130
<i>We have little time. I ask that everyone</i>
<i>gather at the training ship Liebel...</i>

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.260
<i>...located in the central area. I repeat...!</i>

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:13.900
Damn!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.400
Our line has been intercepted
by an emergency override.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.370
That's bad! It's gonna cause greater panic!

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.240
We're falling?

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.710
Hey, are they serious?

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.980
Hey, what's going on?

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:31.920
Didn't you hear the announcement?
Liebe Delta is sinking.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.090
What?

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:43.820
We can escape this way.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.590
- The central area is to our right!
- Okay!

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.040
Damn!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.630
We won't get through here either!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.560
Hey, take it easy.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.420
I'm just doing as you said.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.730
You're the one who told me
to think about right now.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:19.200
You're twisting my words.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.840
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.840
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:36.280
<i>Pat. Don't worry. Stay calm</i>
<i>and follow everyone else.</i>

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:40.650
<i>I'll be waiting at Liebe Delta.</i>
<i>I'll be waiting there for you.</i>

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.390
Okay. I'm to go to the central area, right?

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.460
- Don't leave me behind!
- Area 26 is closer.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.660
- Come on and broadcast!
- Hurry up!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.930
- Hurry or the partitions will close on us.
- Stop pushing!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.340
Faina?

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.300
Faina!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.170
What are you doing? You'd better escape.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:04.180
Faina!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.460
Hey, what was that announcement?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.220
Give me details on the situation!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.690
Teacher!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.660
We're saved!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.360
Damn!

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:23.900
Don't give up.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.930
I know.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:29.440
We might be able to make
it from where we came from.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.740
I'll take a look. You rest here a little.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.910
What the hell am I doing?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.190
This is so frustrating.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.170
Do you wanna die?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.370
What?

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.510
How strange.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.080
What the...?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.880
Kouji! We can get out this way!

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.150
Okay.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.330
You know how to travel through
non-gravitational blocks, right?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.930
There's no need to rush!
There's still plenty of time!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:30.390
Maintain your balance with your hands,
not your feet, like in practice!

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:31.600
Yes, sir!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.570
Go!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.340
Okay! Okay!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:59.190
It appears that they're thinking
of moving this training ship.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:01.130
I'll go and confirm it. Cover for me here.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.230
It's impossible to launch in 12 hours!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.820
But it's our only option!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.500
However...!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.560
We've already cleared past
Phase 2. We've gotta do it!

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.300
I'll take full responsibility!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.560
Hurry!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.520
Right.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.900
She's real, isn't she?

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.360
She must've not made it out in time.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.530
Good. She's just unconscious.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.620
The Regalts have blown
off! We're doomed!

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.790
Calculate the changes to our course!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.960
It's melted to the second layer.
We're not gonna make it in time!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.660
Can you take this into flight by yourselves?

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:04.290
Yes, sir.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.850
Okay, then we'll buy you some time.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.890
This is Campbell to all remaining staff.
Come to Number Six hangar at once.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.040
We're trying to purge everything around
the central area, and build a wall...

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.560
...to slow Liebe Delta's fall.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.110
Please wait! You can't go out there now!

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:23.310
If you do this, you know what'll happen!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:27.750
Adults have what's called responsibility.
You'll eventually know what I mean.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:28.950
Teacher!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:36.460
It's true what they say about
unconscious people being heavy.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.690
At this pace, we won't...!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.160
This time, we're gonna save her.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.360
But we're taking a detour, and besides...!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.870
You suggest we leave her?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.390
I'm not gonna give up on her!

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.900
I know. I never said I would!

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.070
Then what were you trying to say?

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.380
Maybe there's a better way to carry her.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.910
It can't be helped with
gravity weighing us down.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:16:59.880
The container route!

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.990
If we lose our direction, we're finished.

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.920
I know.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.000
Well?

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:22.060
No, nothing. Don't worry!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.110
Yuki!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.710
Hey, Aoi! What is it?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.080
Yuki!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.780
What was that for?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:37.990
Where are Kouji and Ikumi?

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.220
Who knows.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.160
Why aren't you with them?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.490
I've got my own things to take care of!

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:44.490
Like what?

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.220
None of your business!

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:51.030
But you're brothers. He may not seem
like much, but he is your brother!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.900
Aren't you being a little coldhearted?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.930
Stay out of it! It would be
better if he would just disappear!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.610
Yuki! What a terrible thing to say!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.080
What's taking them so long?

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:30.630
I can't hold on any longer!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.640
Don't give up!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.380
Not yet. We can't allow them to be killed!

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.690
As I thought. This is the only route.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:50.760
Isn't there any way we can get it open?

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:52.230
How should I know?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.950
Don't give up so easily! I'll do it!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.670
Ready? On three!

00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.700
Three!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.670
Two!

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:01.640
One!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:02.600
Go!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:20.250
<i>Sorry Pat. I can't keep my promise...</i>

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.680
Separate! I beg you!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.650
Could it be purging?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.630
Purging of all areas complete.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:09.900
Reduction in speed allows us an
additional twenty-three hours.

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:10.640
What is it?

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.710
What happened?

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.640
I'll bet we're in trouble.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:17.350
<i>This is Juli Bahana, second term</i>
<i>Zwei of the Navigation Section.</i>

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:21.020
<i>System changes made it</i>
<i>impossible to communicate sooner.</i>

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:25.290
<i>Liebe Delta is now reduced</i>
<i>to this central pillar only.</i>

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:29.760
<i>We purged the surrounding facilities</i>
<i>to reduce our descending velocity.</i>

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:34.430
<i>We are now proceeding with</i>
<i>our plan to launch the Liebel.</i>

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:39.170
Don't worry. We will be rescued.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.600
To ensure that, I ask for
everyone's further cooperation.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.670
<i>Someone from our section</i>
<i>will be visiting you later.</i>

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.970
That can't be. That can't be.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:53.180
Neither Ikumi nor Kouji
are...! Neither are here.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:57.620
This is no longer connected with
Liebe Delta, and they're not here.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.590
They're nowhere!

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:06.060
- Those guys barely made it.
- Who are they?

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.150
What are you guys doing up there?

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:15.800
They're alive!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.140
We made it.

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:19.840
I told you we'd make it.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.610
We made it by coincidence.

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.580
You really have a way
of dampening the mood.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:25.140
Yahoo! Hello, hello!

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.650
Get real, man.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:34.790
Will you look at that? They were late
'cause they were hitting on some girl?

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:38.350
No. Ikumi was probably saving her
life. But I don't know about Kouji.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.390
You're too kind, foolish big brother!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.690
Infinite Ryvius

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:50.390
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Beyond the Vast Sea

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:01.780
Make re-adjustments to contact point.
Output discrepancies in navigation.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:03.250
You're not getting away, Bratica.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:11.950
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:17.020
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:21.720
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:27.820
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.870
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:46.480
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.480 --> 00:22:54.920
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:58.830
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:05.200
goodbye

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:17.930
Next episode: Beyond the Vast Sea
Work continues to get Liebel
launched and past the Geduld Sea.

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:23.570
Next episode: Beyond the Vast Sea
However, two people appearing
on the bridge changed all that.

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:26.040
Next episode: Beyond the Vast Sea
Everything's being engulfed
by a power we cannot see.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:29.130
Next episode: Beyond the Vast Sea
Even our feelings...
even our thoughts...!
